---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About CompareVue"
  description="We're an independent software review site. We test tools hands-on, compare features, and help businesses make smarter buying decisions."
>
  <!-- ═══ Hero ═══ -->
  <header class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-50/60 via-white to-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #2563eb 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pt-14 sm:pt-20 pb-10 sm:pb-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="mb-6 text-sm text-gray-400" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li class="text-gray-500" aria-current="page">About</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl tracking-tight">About CompareVue</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-500 max-w-2xl text-pretty">We built CompareVue because choosing software shouldn't require a PhD in feature comparison.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ═══ Content ═══ -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-gray max-w-none
      prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-headings:text-gray-900
      prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-14 prose-h2:mb-5
      prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-gray-700
      prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-a:font-medium
      prose-strong:text-gray-900 prose-strong:font-semibold
      prose-li:marker:text-gray-400
      prose-blockquote:border-l-4 prose-blockquote:border-brand-400 prose-blockquote:bg-brand-50/50 prose-blockquote:py-5 prose-blockquote:px-6 prose-blockquote:rounded-r-xl prose-blockquote:not-italic
    ">
      <p>We built CompareVue because <strong>choosing software sucks</strong>. Every tool promises to be "the best" — but best for who? A 5-person startup needs different things than a 500-person enterprise.</p>

      <h2>How We Test</h2>
      <p>We sign up for every tool we review. We test real workflows, not demos. We check support response times, mobile app quality, and the actual onboarding experience. No tool pays for placement — our picks are based on hands-on testing.</p>

      <h2>Our Rating Criteria</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Ease of use</strong> — How fast can a new team get productive?</li>
        <li><strong>Features</strong> — Does the tool actually solve the problem?</li>
        <li><strong>Pricing</strong> — Is the value proportional to the cost?</li>
        <li><strong>Integrations</strong> — Does it plug into your existing stack?</li>
        <li><strong>Support</strong> — What happens when something breaks?</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click and buy, we may earn a commission — at no extra cost to you. This doesn't affect our ratings. We regularly recommend free tools and tools with no affiliate program.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ═══ CTA ═══ -->
    <div class="mt-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-600 via-brand-700 to-brand-800 p-10 sm:p-12 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 28px 28px;"></div>
      <div class="relative">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">See our work in action</h3>
        <p class="text-brand-200/90 max-w-md mx-auto">Browse our comparison library — every page is backed by real testing.</p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <a href="/comparisons" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-50 transition shadow-lg shadow-black/10">
            Browse Comparisons
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
